WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.708
"Mercury Exposure from Tuna vs. Thimerosal in Vaccines"

00:00:07.200 --> 00:00:10.720
Once upon a time,
routine childhood vaccinations

00:00:10.720 --> 00:00:12.960
used a preservative
containing mercury

00:00:12.960 --> 00:00:14.720
called thimerosal.

00:00:14.720 --> 00:00:16.480
I was always surprised
by parents

00:00:16.480 --> 00:00:18.080
who didn't want
to vaccinate their kids

00:00:18.080 --> 00:00:20.000
for fear of exposing them
to mercury,

00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:23.280
yet went on to feed them tuna.

00:00:23.280 --> 00:00:27.120
Each thimerosal-containing shot
would inject roughly

00:00:27.120 --> 00:00:30.240
the same amount of mercury
that's in a can of tuna fish.

00:00:30.240 --> 00:00:32.640
And while a child
may only get a half dozen

00:00:32.640 --> 00:00:34.560
or so mercury-containing shots,

00:00:34.560 --> 00:00:36.400
they could be eating
tuna salad sandwiches

00:00:36.400 --> 00:00:37.760
year after year.

00:00:37.760 --> 00:00:40.000
So, it's evident
that kids would be exposed

00:00:40.000 --> 00:00:42.000
to less mercury from vaccines

00:00:42.000 --> 00:00:44.720
than they would
if they ate fish.

00:00:44.720 --> 00:00:46.480
Though when the mercury
is injected,

00:00:46.480 --> 00:00:48.240
the absorption
is like 100%,

00:00:48.240 --> 00:00:51.440
whereas if we just eat it,
some passes right through.

00:00:51.440 --> 00:00:53.520
We used to think
the gastrointestinal absorption

00:00:53.520 --> 00:00:55.680
of mercury was close to 100%.

00:00:55.680 --> 00:00:57.920
Following ingestion
of the mercury in fish,

00:00:57.920 --> 00:01:02.000
the more updated estimates
are consistently less than 100%.

00:01:02.000 --> 00:01:04.160
On the other hand,
the form of mercury in fish

00:01:04.160 --> 00:01:06.800
is worse than the form
of mercury used in vaccines,

00:01:06.800 --> 00:01:09.280
which is excreted from the body
much more quickly.

00:01:09.280 --> 00:01:13.600
The mercury in fish represents
the greater threat to children,

00:01:13.600 --> 00:01:16.320
but because any potential risk
is a concern,

00:01:16.320 --> 00:01:18.480
in 1999,
the Public Health Service,

00:01:18.480 --> 00:01:20.640
the American Academy
of Pediatrics,

00:01:20.640 --> 00:01:22.160
and vaccine manufacturers,

00:01:22.160 --> 00:01:24.720
agreed that
thimerosal-containing vaccines

00:01:24.720 --> 00:01:27.200
should be removed
as quickly as possible.

00:01:27.200 --> 00:01:28.160
And by 2001,

00:01:28.160 --> 00:01:30.480
thimerosal was removed
from all vaccines

00:01:30.480 --> 00:01:34.160
in the recommended
childhood immunization schedule.

00:01:34.160 --> 00:01:35.440
Currently, in the United States,

00:01:35.440 --> 00:01:39.120
only multidose vial flu vaccines
contain thimerosal,

00:01:39.120 --> 00:01:42.720
and thimerosal-free flu shots
are widely available.

00:01:42.720 --> 00:01:44.800
Flumist,
the nasal spray vaccine,

00:01:44.800 --> 00:01:46.000
is mercury-free,

00:01:46.000 --> 00:01:48.240
as well as most
of the single-dose vials

00:01:48.240 --> 00:01:51.840
used for pregnant women,
which anyone can request.

00:01:51.840 --> 00:01:54.000
Of course, Thimerosal
is still used

00:01:54.000 --> 00:01:56.880
in infants' vaccines
in developing countries.

00:01:56.880 --> 00:01:59.200
If the mercury load
is deemed unacceptable

00:01:59.200 --> 00:02:00.640
in North America and Europe,

00:02:00.640 --> 00:02:02.160
why should it
be given to infants

00:02:02.160 --> 00:02:03.920
in other parts of the world?

00:02:03.920 --> 00:02:06.000
We could also ask,
if we want to play it safe

00:02:06.000 --> 00:02:08.400
and not expose kids
to that much mercury,

00:02:08.400 --> 00:02:10.400
should we be feeding them fish,

00:02:10.400 --> 00:02:12.880
since kids are constantly
getting that much mercury

00:02:12.880 --> 00:02:13.920
in their meals,

00:02:13.920 --> 00:02:16.160
and it's methylmercury,
which is even worse

00:02:16.160 --> 00:02:18.320
than the mercury in vaccines.

00:02:18.320 --> 00:02:20.800
Now, there are ways
to mitigate the mercury

00:02:20.800 --> 00:02:23.680
if you can't beat
some tuna craving.

00:02:23.680 --> 00:02:25.600
Drinking green tea with a meal

00:02:25.600 --> 00:02:27.240
may help block
some of the absorption

00:02:27.240 --> 00:02:29.120
of mercury when eating fish.

00:02:29.120 --> 00:02:31.760
Normally, the recommendation
is to not drink tea with meals,

00:02:31.760 --> 00:02:34.880
because it can also block
the absorption of iron,

00:02:34.880 --> 00:02:35.920
but that's better

00:02:35.920 --> 00:02:38.080
than the other way
to protect yourself,

00:02:38.080 --> 00:02:39.600
shooting up with heroine.

00:02:39.600 --> 00:02:42.240
For some reason, the activation
of opioid receptors

00:02:42.240 --> 00:02:46.095
protects nerves
from mercury toxicity.

